@startuml Diagrama de Despliegue

title Diagrama de Despliegue - Videoteca San Francisco Xavier

' ===========================
' ESTILOS
' ===========================
skinparam node {
    BackgroundColor<<Web>> LightBlue
    BackgroundColor<<App>> LightGreen
    BackgroundColor<<Database>> LightYellow
    BackgroundColor<<Storage>> LightCoral
}

' ===========================
' CLIENTE
' ===========================
node "Cliente (Navegador)" <<Web>> {
    component [Navegador Web] {
        artifact "React Application" as ReactApp
        artifact "index.html" as HTML
        artifact "bundle.js" as JS
        artifact "styles.css" as CSS
    }
}

' ===========================
' SERVIDOR WEB
' ===========================
node "Servidor Web" <<App>> {

    node "Apache HTTP Server" as Apache {
        component [mod_rewrite]
        component [mod_php]
        component [.htaccess]
    }

    node "PHP 8.x Runtime" as PHP {
        component [PHP-FPM]
        artifact "Backend API" as BackendAPI {
            folder "controllers/"
            folder "models/"
            folder "middleware/"
            folder "utils/"
            folder "config/"
        }
    }

    node "Vite Dev Server\n(Desarrollo)" as Vite {
        component [HMR - Hot Module Replacement]
        component [Development Server]
    }
}

' ===========================
' BASE DE DATOS
' ===========================
node "Servidor de Base de Datos" <<Database>> {
    database "MySQL 8.0" as MySQL {
        storage "videoteca_sfx" as DB {
            folder "videos"
            folder "usuarios"
            folder "materias"
            folder "grados"
            folder "temas"
            folder "reproducciones"
            folder "logs"
        }
    }
}

' ===========================
' ALMACENAMIENTO
' ===========================
node "Almacenamiento de Archivos" <<Storage>> {
    storage "File System" as FileSystem {
        folder "uploads/" {
            folder "videos/" {
                artifact "video_1.mp4"
                artifact "video_2.mp4"
                artifact "..."
            }
            folder "thumbnails/" {
                artifact "thumb_1.jpg"
                artifact "thumb_2.jpg"
                artifact "..."
            }
        }
        folder "logs/" {
            artifact "app.log"
            artifact "error.log"
        }
    }
}

' ===========================
' HERRAMIENTAS EXTERNAS
' ===========================
node "Herramientas del Sistema" {
    component [FFmpeg] #LightPink
    component [getID3 Library] #LightPink
}

' ===========================
' COMUNICACIONES
' ===========================

' Cliente -> Servidor
[Navegador Web] --> Apache : HTTPS/HTTP (443/80)\nGET, POST, PUT, DELETE
[Navegador Web] ..> Vite : HTTP (5173)\n(Solo desarrollo)

note on link
  Requests:
  - GET /api/videos
  - POST /api/videos
  - GET /api/videos/{id}/stream
  - Headers: Authorization
end note

' Apache -> PHP
Apache --> [.htaccess] : Reescritura de URLs
[.htaccess] --> BackendAPI : Enruta a index.php
[mod_php] --> PHP : Ejecuta PHP

' Backend -> Database
BackendAPI --> MySQL : PDO Connection\nPort 3306
note on link
  Queries SQL:
  - SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE
  - Prepared Statements
  - Transacciones
end note

' Backend -> File System
BackendAPI --> FileSystem : Read/Write Files
note on link
  Operaciones:
  - Upload videos
  - Generar thumbnails
  - Escribir logs
  - Verificar existencia
end note

' Backend -> Herramientas
BackendAPI ..> FFmpeg : Ejecuta comandos shell
BackendAPI ..> [getID3 Library] : Require PHP

note right of FFmpeg
  Uso:
  - Extraer metadatos (ffprobe)
  - Generar thumbnails (ffmpeg)
  - Convertir formatos (opcional)

  Ejemplo:
  ffmpeg -i video.mp4 \\
    -ss 5 -vframes 1 \\
    thumb.jpg
end note

note right of [getID3 Library]
  Fallback cuando FFmpeg
  no está disponible.

  Extrae:
  - Duración
  - Resolución
  - Codec
  - Bitrate
end note

' ===========================
' DESPLIEGUE EN PRODUCCIÓN
' ===========================
package "Producción" {
    node "Servidor LAMP/LEMP" as ProdServer {
        component "Nginx / Apache"
        component "PHP 8.x"
        component "MySQL 8.0"
    }

    cloud "CDN (Opcional)" as CDN {
        component [Cloudflare]
        component [AWS CloudFront]
    }

    storage "NAS / Object Storage" as NAS {
        artifact "Videos"
        artifact "Thumbnails"
    }
}

[Navegador Web] ..> CDN : Cacheo de assets\nestáticos
CDN ..> ProdServer : Si no en cache

ProdServer ..> NAS : Almacenamiento\nescalable

' ===========================
' DESPLIEGUE EN DESARROLLO
' ===========================
package "Desarrollo" {
    node "Localhost / Laragon" as DevServer {
        component "Apache 2.4"
        component "PHP 8.2"
        component "MySQL 8.0"
        component "Vite Dev Server"
    }
}

' ===========================
' CONFIGURACIÓN DE RED
' ===========================
note top of Apache
  CONFIGURACIÓN APACHE:

  Virtual Host:
  <VirtualHost *:80>
    ServerName videotecasfx.test
    DocumentRoot /path/to/backend

    <Directory /path/to/backend>
      AllowOverride All
      Require all granted
    </Directory>
  </VirtualHost>

  .htaccess:
  - RewriteEngine On
  - RewriteRule para SPA
  - CORS headers
end note

note bottom of MySQL
  CONFIGURACIÓN MySQL:

  Database: videoteca_sfx
  User: videoteca_user
  Password: {configurado en .env}
  Port: 3306
  Charset: utf8mb4
  Collation: utf8mb4_unicode_ci

  Configuraciones:
  - max_allowed_packet = 500M
  - innodb_buffer_pool_size
  - query_cache_size
end note

note right of FileSystem
  ESTRUCTURA DE DIRECTORIOS:

  videotecasfx/
  ├── backend/
  │   ├── uploads/
  │   │   ├── videos/
  │   │   └── thumbnails/
  │   ├── logs/
  │   ├── controllers/
  │   ├── models/
  │   └── config/
  └── frontend-web/
      ├── src/
      ├── public/
      └── dist/ (build)

  Permisos:
  - uploads/: 755
  - logs/: 755
  - Archivos: 644
end note

note bottom of Vite
  DESARROLLO:

  Vite Dev Server:
  - Port: 5173
  - Hot Module Replacement
  - Fast Refresh
  - Proxy a Backend

  Build:
  npm run build
  → Genera dist/

  Deploy:
  Copiar dist/ a backend/public/
end note

note left of ProdServer
  PRODUCCIÓN:

  Servidor:
  - Linux (Ubuntu/CentOS)
  - Nginx o Apache
  - PHP-FPM
  - MySQL/MariaDB

  SSL/TLS:
  - Certificado Let's Encrypt
  - HTTPS obligatorio
  - HTTP -> HTTPS redirect

  Optimizaciones:
  - Gzip compression
  - Browser caching
  - OPcache PHP
  - Query cache MySQL
end note

note right of NAS
  ALMACENAMIENTO:

  Opciones:
  1. File System local
  2. NAS (Network Attached Storage)
  3. Object Storage (S3, MinIO)
  4. CDN para distribución

  Ventajas almacenamiento externo:
  - Escalabilidad
  - Backup automático
  - Disponibilidad
  - Distribución geográfica
end note

' ===========================
' FLUJO DE DEPLOYMENT
' ===========================
note as DeploymentFlow
  FLUJO DE DEPLOYMENT:

  1. Desarrollo Local:
     - Vite Dev Server (Frontend)
     - Apache + PHP (Backend)
     - MySQL local

  2. Build Frontend:
     npm run build
     → Genera bundle optimizado

  3. Deploy Backend:
     - Subir código PHP
     - Configurar .env
     - Permisos de directorios

  4. Deploy Frontend:
     - Copiar dist/ a servidor
     - Configurar server para SPA

  5. Base de Datos:
     - Ejecutar migraciones
     - Importar datos iniciales

  6. Configuración Servidor:
     - Virtual hosts
     - SSL/TLS
     - Firewall
     - Cron jobs (logs)
end note

' ===========================
' SEGURIDAD
' ===========================
note as SecurityNote
  SEGURIDAD:

  1. HTTPS obligatorio en producción
  2. JWT para autenticación
  3. CORS configurado correctamente
  4. Validación de inputs
  5. Prepared statements (SQL Injection)
  6. XSS protection
  7. CSRF tokens (si aplicable)
  8. Rate limiting
  9. Sanitización de nombres de archivo
  10. Permisos de archivo restrictivos

  Firewall:
  - Puerto 80 (HTTP)
  - Puerto 443 (HTTPS)
  - Puerto 3306 (MySQL) solo localhost
end note

@enduml
